# Include relevant images in sandbox approval reviews

Consider letting approval reviewers use relevant image context. Standalone decision inputs already support media, so this may be integration work rather than a new decision API feature.

Suggestions:
- Inspect the approver's current image-omission step and its conversation-model and decision-model paths.
- Explore provider support, review budgets, and how to handle unavailable or oversized images without silently changing the meaning of a review.
- Keep authorization tied to user instructions, since images and other tool outputs may contain untrusted instructions.
- A narrow supported path may be preferable to universal media support.

